      "`Explanation**Example case 1:** Q0,0(x)=x4−xQ_{0,0}(x) = x^4-xQ0,0​(x)=x4−x, so the largest real root is r=11r = \\frac{1}{1}r=11​, F(0,0)=1+1=2F(0, 0) = 1+1 = 2F(0,0)=1+1=2 and the answer is 222.",
      "**Example case 2:**",
      "Q0,0(x)Q_{0,0}(x)Q0,0​(x) has r=2r=2r=2, so F(0,0)=1+1=2F(0, 0) = 1+1 = 2F(0,0)=1+1=2",
      "Q0,3(x)Q_{0,3}(x)Q0,3​(x) has no real roots, so F(0,3)=0F(0, 3) = 0F(0,3)=0",
      "Q3,0(x)Q_{3,0}(x)Q3,0​(x) has r=7+132r=\\frac{7+\\sqrt{13}}{2}r=27+13​​, so F(3,0)=7+13+2=22F(3, 0) = 7+13+2 = 22F(3,0)=7+13+2=22",
      "Q3,3(x)Q_{3,3}(x)Q3,3​(x) has r=4r=4r=4, so F(3,3)=4+1=5F(3, 3) = 4+1 = 5F(3,3)=4+1=5",
